\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of WarrantRoute. An interpretable policy routes source grounded theme and evidence packets to researchers alone, a qualitative methods expert, a domain expert, or both within a fixed time budget. We evaluate routing on CaCHe and Dreaddit and test whether expert feedback repairs errors without creating new ones.}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
